{"3963300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "REPOSSESSION: Mafia Debt", "steam_appid": 3963300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.poster.avif?t=1774476665\" width=600 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.webm?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.mp4?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.poster.avif?t=1774476665\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.webm?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.mp4?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Congratulations—you’ve just landed the worst job of your life.</strong><br>Forget desks, stamps, and boring paperwork. Here, you’re a debt collector for the mob, and your “home visits” look less like routine inspections and more like desperate survival missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.poster.avif?t=1774476665\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.webm?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.mp4?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your clients? Not ordinary tenants behind on rent. Think basement <strong>chemists with secret labs, trappers who lace every hallway with snares, and a full gallery of lunatics</strong> who’d rather turn their flat into a war zone than hand over a dime. Every debtor is a unique challenge—new traps, new behavior, new ways to send you to an early grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.poster.avif?t=1774476665\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.webm?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.mp4?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your job sounds simple: <strong>go in, grab whatever you can, and get out alive</strong>. In practice, it means dodging explosions, disarming bizarre contraptions, searching every corner, and praying your teammate doesn’t press the one thing they absolutely shouldn’t. If anything can go wrong—it will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.poster.avif?t=1774476665\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.webm?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.mp4?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You don’t have to work alone. Team up and raid debtor hideouts together to boost your odds of success—or at least have someone to blame when everything blows up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the day, the mafia doesn’t care about excuses. They only care about what you bring back. Will you return as a clever debt enforcer or end up as another unlucky expense in the books? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The weirdest job ever</strong> – a repo man armed with a crowbar and flashlight instead of a folder of paperwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique debtors</strong> – each with their own personality, hazards, and twisted ways to get rid of you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op</strong> – brave it solo or form a crew where someone’s always responsible for the next explosion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless risk</strong> – every mission brings new, unpredictable situations ready to spiral out of control.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.poster.avif?t=1774476665\" width=600 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.webm?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.mp4?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.poster.avif?t=1774476665\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.webm?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.mp4?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Congratulations—you’ve just landed the worst job of your life.</strong><br>Forget desks, stamps, and boring paperwork. Here, you’re a debt collector for the mob, and your “home visits” look less like routine inspections and more like desperate survival missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.poster.avif?t=1774476665\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.webm?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.mp4?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your clients? Not ordinary tenants behind on rent. Think basement <strong>chemists with secret labs, trappers who lace every hallway with snares, and a full gallery of lunatics</strong> who’d rather turn their flat into a war zone than hand over a dime. Every debtor is a unique challenge—new traps, new behavior, new ways to send you to an early grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.poster.avif?t=1774476665\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.webm?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.mp4?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your job sounds simple: <strong>go in, grab whatever you can, and get out alive</strong>. In practice, it means dodging explosions, disarming bizarre contraptions, searching every corner, and praying your teammate doesn’t press the one thing they absolutely shouldn’t. If anything can go wrong—it will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.poster.avif?t=1774476665\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.webm?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.mp4?t=1774476665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You don’t have to work alone. Team up and raid debtor hideouts together to boost your odds of success—or at least have someone to blame when everything blows up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the day, the mafia doesn’t care about excuses. They only care about what you bring back. Will you return as a clever debt enforcer or end up as another unlucky expense in the books? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The weirdest job ever</strong> – a repo man armed with a crowbar and flashlight instead of a folder of paperwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique debtors</strong> – each with their own personality, hazards, and twisted ways to get rid of you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op</strong> – brave it solo or form a crew where someone’s always responsible for the next explosion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless risk</strong> – every mission brings new, unpredictable situations ready to spiral out of control.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "As a mafia-hired repo man, you break into debtors’ homes where people would rather blow up their own apartment than pay a single cent. Grab the loot, dodge traps, and escape before the place turns into a war zone—preferably with a crew of friends, as in this line of work chaos is business as usual.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Spanish - Latin America, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Romanian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/386537b3d48251f3f799a1f451db897bdb210297/header.jpg?t=1774476665", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap